25,2,1,talk,Minako,,"It takes over an hour and a half for a full pass. Also, our definitions of ""done"" are completely different, which explains the inconsistency.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The usage is very uneven; a few of us do almost all the cooking. Plus, people are away frequently, making a strict rota difficult.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"The bathroom gets dirty again in less than two weeks no matter what! And @Minako is right, we don't all clean the same way.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"We are spending quite a bit on supplies, often buying duplicates. A professional cleaner is available, but the billing goes to one person.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Servas,,"Our past arguments are all about reminders. Interestingly, the previous tenants tried permanent assignments and ended up barely speaking.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, if usage is uneven, a simple rotation might feel unfair to those who don't use the kitchen.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,Exactly. A fixed rota ignores the fact that some of us aren't even here for weeks at a time.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"But if we don't have a rule, I'll keep guessing if the bathroom is gross or not.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"If we hire someone, we can avoid the arguments @Servas mentioned, provided we handle the money clearly.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Servas,,"I worry that any system that feels like ""policing"" will destroy our friendship. We need a peaceful solution.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,Minako,,"A professional service removes the labor entirely, which solves my time concern and the ""definition of done"" issue.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,It would certainly be the most logical way to decouple usage from labor.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,Sakura,,Would a professional make the bathroom stay clean longer?,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"It would be consistent, though we must ensure the billing is transparent so no one is out of pocket.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Servas,,"As long as it stops the nagging and the rows, I am in favor of a neutral third party.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
