50,3,1,talk,Minako,,"The options are a Fixed Weekly Rota, a Paid Cleaning Service, or Standing Assignments. I vote for the Paid Cleaning Service.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Given the uneven usage and absences, the Paid Cleaning Service is the only rational choice. I vote for that.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Sakura,,I like the idea of it always being clean without fighting. I vote for the Paid Cleaning Service too!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Shizue,,I believe a Paid Cleaning Service will keep us happy and the finances can be managed. My vote is for that.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Servas,,"To preserve our harmony and avoid the fate of the previous tenants, I vote for the Paid Cleaning Service.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
